# Trivy CVE allow-list — audited exceptions only.
#
# Every line must include the CVE ID + a rationale. NEVER blanket-skip.
# When a patched upstream lands or we migrate the dependency, REMOVE the
# corresponding line.
#
# The image + lockfile scans in deploy.yml run with `--ignore-unfixed`, so
# CVEs with no upstream patch never reach this file — only add a fixable
# HIGH/CRITICAL here, and only with an audited not-applicable justification.
#
# (No exceptions currently. Keep it that way.)
